* rept around one dc line becomes that line's list repeated, here over 4 KB of text (800
* elements of $0200): the translation's formatted output stopped at 4096 characters, so the
* list was cut (682 elements) and the data came out short.
* fixed: pending
* expect size: .data 00000640
Count equ 800
 psect rept_long_list,0,0,0,0,0
 vsect
Table: rept Count
 dc.w $0200
 endr
 ends
 nop
 ends
